# Files kept out of the image build context: the build needs the Go sources, go.mod, go.sum and the licence, nothing else.
# Build inputs that are never copied into an image layer:
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# Documentation and repository metadata.
*.md
.gitignore
# Environment files can hold secrets; a context must never carry them.
.env*
# CI and release tooling that runs outside the image.
.github/
.git
# The repository-level machine-readable description; it is not served by this service.
llms.txt
